                                        "entry_id": "31e2ce14-c09d-3098-bd77-b8e0c57d3ac7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sausage-like meat dish in the cuisine of Louisiana, made from pork, rice, vegetables and spices sewn up and cooked in a pig's stomach."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
